WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.826
Before you sign a lease, a loan, or a job offer, do you understand every clause?

00:00:04.826 --> 00:00:05.455
Brief does.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.584
Sign in with Google, and a short tour shows you around.

00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:15.613
No file?

00:00:15.613 --> 00:00:18.359
Snap up to five photos of the paper contract.

00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:21.226
Brief makes them one document, a page for each.

00:00:25.548 --> 00:00:29.821
Brief splits it into numbered clauses and lists every key term with its quote.

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:32.012
Click one, and the exact words light up.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:36.360
It flags the questions people forget to ask, with wording you can send.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:37.954
Ask in plain words.

00:00:37.954 --> 00:00:42.459
Every answer cites its clause, and if the document does not say, Brief says so.

00:00:47.032 --> 00:00:51.939
Share your dashboard with someone you trust, for a time you choose, and take it back whenever you like.

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.159
Deleted by mistake?

00:00:54.159 --> 00:00:56.092
The Bin keeps it for seven days.

00:00:56.092 --> 00:00:58.750
Two-step sign-in and dark mode are built in.

00:01:01.466 --> 00:01:02.888
Under the hood, a Next.

00:01:02.888 --> 00:01:06.351
js website signs you in and keeps every request private.

00:01:06.751 --> 00:01:12.597
A FastAPI service reads your document, and Postgres with pgvector finds the right clauses.

00:01:12.997 --> 00:01:17.754
Gemini writes the answer, and Brief checks every quote word for word before you see it.

00:01:18.904 --> 00:01:19.250
Brief.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:20.635
Every clause, explained.

00:01:20.635 --> 00:01:22.424
Not legal advice, just clarity.
